repository-code: "https://github.com/RitaJeronimo/Phisys"
abstract: >
  Phisys is a gamified educational application for Cardiovascular
  and Renal Physiology, designed as a learning object for
  undergraduate students. It simulates physiological scenarios
  through a virtual mascot whose survival depends on the
  student's correct responses to clinical challenges.
license: MIT
